    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just poetic though. it feels more like a fact. like everything is just a machine and i'm just this glitch that doesn't matter. it's exhausting trying to pretend i'm a real person when i know i'm just nothing. do you think it's even worth trying to stay part of it?",
